WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:03,140
When you drive this car, put your luggage in the back.

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:10,500
Eat and drink as you please

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,900
Two people take turns driving, don't be too tired

4
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:19,420
Thank you Brother Liu

5
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:23,060
The two cars were just downsized a while ago.

6
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,260
I filled up the tank and washed the car this morning.

7
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:27,060
The windows are all covered with anti-defect film

8
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,460
The quilt was also replaced with a new one.

9
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,060
Awesome, really capable

10
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,060
Get in the car

11
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:39,630
Little sister, sit down with me

12
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:45,720
Passing by the wholesale market, can you park your car for a while?

13
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,720
That's where we rented the warehouse before

14
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,520
Just in time to buy something

15
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:51,920
The one I rented for filming the 99 times when the young lady escaped from marriage.

16
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,720
Okay, just stock up on more.
